    "blurb": "Intelligent hospital workflows with AI",
    "overview": "Automate hospital workflows from patient discharge to insurance claims using Camunda 8 and AWS Bedrock AI. Includes emergency triage, resource management, nurse scheduling, and prior authorization with agentic AI.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "AI-Powered Healthcare Workflow Automation",
    "splashDescription": "An end-to-end healthcare integration platform that automates critical hospital processes using Camunda 8 and AI-powered decision-making via AWS Bedrock. The blueprint covers patient discharge to insurance claim processing,\n  emergency department triage and resource management, prior authorization with agentic AI, and nurse scheduling optimization. It demonstrates dynamic prompt engineering with Mistral 7B for discharge validation, claim\n  preparation, claim submission, payment processing, and record updates. The platform includes real-time resource reservation, multi-channel specialist notifications (pager, SMS, Teams, Slack, mobile), intelligent triage with\n  symptom analysis, and an autonomous AI agent system with learning capabilities. Built with Spring Boot 3.2.5, Java 17, and Zeebe, the blueprint integrates with healthcare standards including HL7/FHIR, ICD-10, CPT codes, DRG\n  classifications, and EDI 837/835 claim formats. A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server enables Claude AI integration with 15+ specialized healthcare tools. Includes Docker Compose setup for local development with Zeebe,\n  Operate, Tasklist, and Elasticsearch.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/778691/overview/img8014398170544023832.png?5cc3647cf2af7545dbd05eef76e44dbd",
    "imageSrcset": {
      "default": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/778691/overview/img8014398170544023832.png",
